The prototype changes vLLM (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm, Apache License 2.0) at run time with hooks and
wrappers. It contains no vLLM source file. Some tests restate small rules of the pinned vLLM commit
3966924d566340e971a6da313e790d05492aa505 (for example, the NIXL region rule in
experiments/gemma4_kv_disagg/test_e70.py) to check the prototype against them.

The release contains no model weights and no captured activations. The Gemma 4 weights, the GSM8K data set and the
PG-19 books have their own licenses on their own pages.
